0x1422657e307ee05fadffb7280a3be9c9b31e3748dad4b854b6da659a91d93e36,2026-04-20 21:03:48.427,James Harden: Points O/U 21.5,6,1776751200,t,"In the upcoming NBA game, scheduled for April 20 at 7:00 PM ET:
