0x7792b0063ce7859a126236b6ff99896ed9b61c46aef4a3e77e93a2fb7498af97,2026-04-18 21:05:31.348,James Harden: Assists O/U 7.5,6,1776556800,f,"In the upcoming NBA game, scheduled for April 18 at 1:00 PM ET:
This market will resolve to ""Yes"" if James Harden records more than 7.5 assists during the game.
This market will resolve to ""No"" if James Harden records 7.5 assists or fewer during the game.
The entire game including all overtime periods will be considered.
