0x3303b36386f184bb176e01c2655e53ae36b46b13f1498e209ca554b59110e5c4,2026-04-13 23:03:04.935,Will Raptors vs Cavaliers total be over 219.5?,6,1776556800,f,"In the upcoming NBA game, scheduled for April 18 at 1:00PM ET:
This market will resolve to ""Over"" if the Raptors and Cavaliers combine to score 220 or more points in this game.
