0xe672a023070559745290e22390b0c27a6a38ae0ddd07b082af901795ffd94466,2026-04-13 22:04:02.518,Will Microsoft have the best AI model at the end of April 2026?,3,1777607940,t,"This market will resolve according to the company that owns the model that has the highest arena score based on the Chatbot Arena LLM Leaderboard (https://lmarena.ai/) when the table under the ""Leaderboard"" tab is checked on April 30, 2026, 12:00 PM ET.
