0x6f19d9353a050b75146deab85790798008f71b699232e5e237e2f46d2cb5dc2b,2026-04-09 00:14:33.417,"Will Iran strike Iraq by April 30, 2026?",4,1777607940,f,"This market will resolve to ""Yes"" if Iran initiates a drone, missile, or air strike on the listed country's soil or any official embassy or consulate of the listed country between market creation and April 30, 2026, 11:59 PM (ET). Otherwise, this market will resolve to ""No"".
