0x07d9784de3295c94bd154a696e6c6cb7d929fcbf686caf950f310e7caad548d4,2026-04-09 00:13:25.02,Will Billie Eilish have the greatest number of monthly Spotify listeners this month?,7,1777579200,t,"This market will resolve according to the listed artist with the greatest number of monthly listeners according to Spotify on April 30, 2026, 12PM ET.
The monthly listener count is listed on each artist's public Spotify profile. Only primary artist profiles will qualify; features or collaborations under another artist profile will not count towards the featured artist's total.
