0x72bf021e264f8f376b32c10612d275b4e2901f4cc204660fb5d9d9cfee266c20,2026-04-04 22:32:10.318,Will Roberto Sánchez Palomino win the first round of the 2026 Peruvian presidential elections by any margin?,4,1776067200,t,"First-round presidential elections are scheduled to be held in Peru on April 12, 2026, with a potential second round on June 7, 2026, if no candidate receives more than 50% of the valid votes outright.
