0xa44b4a6a44a46dec47b4faafa8eadd8f7507a55d4b02d9b947ad2d5f67ee8415,2026-04-04 20:25:43.819,Will Enrique Valderrama finish in fourth place in the first round of the 2026 Peruvian presidential election?,4,1776067200,t,"First-round presidential elections are scheduled to be held in Peru on April 12, 2026, with a potential second round on June 7, 2026, if no candidate receives more than 50% of the valid votes outright.
This market will resolve according to the listed candidate who receives the fourth-most valid votes in the first round of this election.
