A party will only be considered part of the coalition if it signs the coalition agreement and provides at least one cabinet minister. Parties that merely support the government (e.g., through confidence-and-supply arrangements, parliamentary support agreements, or similar) without signing the coalition agreement and holding a cabinet post will not qualify.
If no government is formed, or the results are not known definitively by January 31, 2027, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to “No”.
This market will resolve based on a consensus of credible reporting. In case of ambiguity, this market will resolve based on official information from the Government of Slovenia.",{https://polymarket.com/event/which-parties-will-be-part-of-the-next-government-of-slovenia#will-the-slovenian-democratic-party-sds-be-part-of-the-next-government-of-slovenia-311},SDS in Slovenia Gov?,5064014,f,f,,,,0,101293,0,0x19e34db5bef20ef0613854c3670cd809deff4035,0,f,{},0.935,23439.78360199999,https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-slovenian-democratic-party-sds-win-the-most-seats-in-the-2026-slovenian-parliamentary-election-344-juorimgRWZhU.png,0,16.76,179.897991,1255.545888,0,16.76,179.897991,1255.545888,
