If the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. 
The resolution source for this market will be official information from https://liquipedia.net/leagueoflegends/Main_Page.",{https://polymarket.com#lol-gal-es-2026-01-28},"Galions beats Esprit Shōnen? (LoL, LFL Invitational Group D)",5064014,f,f,,,,0,,,0xdc1fa830ad1de01f1ef603749f48bd73384286be,0,f,{},,0,,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,
